{"The addGuests mutation does not normalize or enforce unique guest emails server-side, and its blacklist/existing-attendee checks are case-sensitive, allowing duplicate attendee rows and bypassing BLACKLISTED_GUEST_EMAILS via case variants": 0.965756893157959, "isTeamAdminOrOwner uses logical AND between isTeamAdmin and isTeamOwner, which effectively restricts access to team OWNERS only and rejects team ADMINs, preventing legitimate team admins from adding guests to team bookings": 0.9824689626693726, "addGuestsHandler calls sendAddGuestsEmails with the raw input guests array instead of the actually-added uniqueGuests list, causing existing attendees included in the request to receive the wrong email template": 0.9519989490509033, "sendAddGuestsEmails does not accept or check EventType metadata disableStandardEmails flags, meaning host/attendee emails may be sent even when standard emails are disabled for the event type": 0.7153792977333069, "AddGuestsDialog sets isInvalidEmail to true on validation failure but never resets it on successful submission or when the dialog is closed via overlay/X, causing the validation error banner to persist across future openings": 0.8909017443656921}